# pst-gate does not load this file.
# `pst-gate decide` / `pst-gate validate` need no API keys.
#
# Copy to .env only as a local reminder, or if you run the example app.

# --- GitHub Actions secrets (repo Settings → Secrets, not this file) ---
# SNYK_TOKEN=
#   Optional. Used only by the reusable workflow (.github/workflows/gate.yml)
#   to run `snyk test`. If unset, that step is skipped. Trivy still runs.
# GITHUB_TOKEN is injected by GitHub Actions for sticky PR comments.
# Do not put GITHUB_TOKEN here.

# --- Example consumer app only (examples/consumer) ---
# WEBHOOK_SECRET=change-me
# PORT=8080
